`,"^Rick: 1981. Punk venue.",`
`,"^Rick: 1989. Jazz club. Three weeks. Bad idea.",`
`,"ev","str","^Why was jazz a bad idea?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0",flg:4},"ev","str","^What happened in the '90s?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1",flg:4},"ev","str","^Back to other topics.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2",flg:4},{"c-0":[`
