`,{"->":"main_menu"},null]}],null],venue_history_3:[["^Rick: 2015. Venue almost closed.",`
`,"^Rick: Saved by a charity concert. Twelve bands. Forty-seven noise complaints.",`
`,"^Rick: 2020. ...closed. Obviously.",`
