`,"^Rick: Now... *gestures at everything*",`
`,"^Rick: ...this.",`
`,"ev","str","^You've been here through all of it?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0",flg:4},"ev","str","^Wow. That's... a lot of history.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1",flg:4},{"c-0":[`
